<view class="page"
  ><view class="hero"
    ><view class="title">绑定学生账号</view
    ><view class="subtitle">微信与学号一对一绑定，请仔细核对</view></view
  ><view class="card"
    ><text class="label">学号 / 用户名</text
    ><input
      class="input"
      value="{{username}}"
      maxlength="64"
      data-field="username"
      bindinput="input"
      placeholder="输入预先创建的学生账号"
    /><text class="label">账号密码</text
    ><input
      class="input"
      password
      value="{{password}}"
      maxlength="64"
      data-field="password"
      bindinput="input"
      placeholder="输入学生账号密码"
    /><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view
    ><button
      class="primary"
      bindtap="submit"
      disabled="{{busy}}"
      loading="{{busy}}"
    >
      验证并绑定</button
    ><button class="secondary" bindtap="back" disabled="{{busy}}">
      返回微信登录</button
    ><view class="notice"
      >绑定凭证5分钟内有效，仅成功使用一次；已有绑定请联系管理员，不会覆盖原关系。</view
    ></view
  ></view
>
